y; this registered consumer retains its behavior, markup, authority and scoped store fields. Actual API recovery, shared shell/workbench and Save/Send selectors plus final typecheck cover the changed/cross-consumer boundary. Retain the original broader outcome with its original source/tool/artifact binding and unchanged dependency proof.\",\n    \"test:C47/frontend/3\": \"The frontend change is the hash-pinned API recovery state and its App observation hook only; this registered consumer retains its behavior, markup, authority and scoped store fields. Actual API recovery, shared shell/workbench and Save/Send selectors plus final typecheck cover the changed/cross-consumer boundary. Retain the original broader outcome with its original source/tool/artifact binding and unchanged dependency proof.\",\n    \"test:C47/frontend/4\": \"The frontend change is the hash-pinned API recovery state and its App observation hook only; this registered consumer retains its behavior, markup, authority and scoped store fields. Actual API recovery, shared shell/workbench and Save/Send selectors plus final typecheck cover the changed/cross-consumer boundary. Retain the original broader outcome with its original source/tool/artifact binding and unchanged dependency proof.\",\n    \"test:C48/fixture\": \"The registered Rust/bindings/contract target is unaffected: no production Rust, contract, lock/toolchain or resource input changed. Exact changed integration fixture files are separately verified by nine actual named tests and their scoped Clippy; the new build example has its own Clippy/preflight/build evidence. Original raw Check/Test outcomes, including failed whole-run status, retain original sources and provenance.\",\n    \"test:C48/host/1\": \"The registered Rust/bindings/contract target is unaffected: no production Rust, contract, lock/toolchain or resource input changed. Exact changed integration fixture files are separately verified by nine actual named tests and their scoped Cli